      "message": "Yes, it relies on entries sharing a Name being published on one object, which https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/96104 marks with `Configuration.Object`. \nI agree it deserves its own proposal and I\u0027m writing a design doc for it now. One point it will make is that a device whose inventory is created by more than one service has to be described in the EM configuration, since a device without an EM entry has no object to coalesce on.\nI\u0027ve also noted this in the `Problem Description`.",
